<title>USA: Shopsmith Inc year net falls.</title>
<headline>Shopsmith Inc year net falls.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, Ohio 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the Years Ended</p>
<p>							 Apr 5,     Mar 30,</p>
<p>							  1997	  1996</p>
<p> Net sales				    $18,469,000 $17,410,000</p>
<p>Income before income taxes and extraordinary item</p>
<p>						    1,803,000   1,514,000</p>
<p> Income tax benefit				    --     743,000</p>
<p> Extraordinary item				    --     771,000</p>
<p> Net income				     1,803,000   3,028,000</p>
<p>Income per share:</p>
<p>   Before taxes and extraordinary item	 0.66	  0.57</p>
<p>   Before extraordinary item		     0.66	  0.84</p>
<p>   Extraordinary item				  --	  0.29</p>
<p>   Net income					  0.66	  1.13</p>
<p>NOTE:  Shopsmith Inc said its fiscal year ended April 5.</p>
<p>In fiscal 1996, the company realized a $771,000, or $0.29 per share, extraordinary gain from extinguishment of debt and a $743,000, or $0.27 per share, income tax benefit due to a reduction in deferred tax valuation allowances.</p>
</text>
